      "notes": "sure.yaml model + loader: privacy/protection/execution/analysis/project_intent/checks/report all parse; every invalid-config path stops the run with a message naming the setting, the expected values, a typo suggestion and the file; requested_privileges/scope_reductions enumerate every privileged and scope-reducing setting; no config field accepts a credential and values reaching diagnostics are redacted. 70 sure-core tests + 9 filesystem tests. Gates: fmt, check, clippy -D warnings, test --workspace, validate-bootstrap, git-guard all clean."
    },
